3,"Dusner Language (DSN) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status, Map ...",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/dsn/,"Dusner is an endangered indigenous language of Indonesia. It belongs to the Austronesian language family. Direct evidence is lacking, but the language is thought to be used as a first language by the elderly only. It is not known to be taught in schools.",Dusner,Austronesian
